{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於熱愛騎行並重視單車保養的用戶而言，Velo Garage 是一款功能強大的全能工具。它將單車資料、維修記錄及騎乘數據整合於一處，現正從原價 US $0.99 轉為限時免費，是 iPhone 與 iPad 用戶整理車庫資訊的理想選擇。</p>\n\n<h2>智能追蹤提醒</h2>\n<p>這款應用提供完整的單車車庫管理，支援儲存照片與規格，並透過里程或時間設定維修提醒。內建專業輪胎氣壓計算器，根據體重、地形等多種變數推薦最佳數值。此外，它能同步 Strava 等平台的騎乘紀錄，自動更新單車總里程，幫助車友精準掌握車輛狀態，確保每次出發前都能維持最佳性能表現。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1325-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1326-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1327-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1328-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1329-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1330-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Velo Garage: Service Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T00:18:37.389337+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}